WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:05,380
Brother Luo can't go

2
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,380
The place where my sister’s accident happened was not there at all.

3
00:00:07,380 --> 00:00:09,380
Going is a waste of time

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:13,300
Didn't you just say that you were too frightened?

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,300
I can't even figure out the exact location.

6
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:17,300
Why are you so sure now?

7
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:30,130
Set sail at full speed to the outer sea diplomatic area.
